I'm not sure how your ran it, but pasting (only) the code parts worked for me. YOu might need to hit enter after pasting the top block.

Specifically I first pasted the top block (then hit enter):

## function that uses the CLT to generate standard normals from uniform
## n is the number of standard normal random numbers to generate
## m is the number of uniforms to generate for using the CLT

CLT_normal <-
function(n, m){
  z <- rep(0,n)
  for(i in 1:n){
    u <- runif(m,0,1)
    s <- sum(u)
    z[i] <- (s-m/2) / (m/12)
  }
  return(z)
}
